Thoron: send Global Privacy Control with Chromium's own implementation.

Chromium 158 implements GPC (the Sec-GPC header and navigator.globalPrivacyControl) with a settings toggle.
Turn it on by default, as Thorium's GPC patch did, and always show the toggle instead of only in some
locations, so it can be switched back on after switching it off. Replaces the Cromite GPC patch.

Origin: Thoron
Author: KuchiSofts
License: BSD-3-Clause

